<item><title>Djibouti recommends four more coaching days for 24 farm cooperatives</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-recommends-four-more-coaching-days-for-24-farm-e0eeb1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-recommends-four-more-coaching-days-for-24-farm-e0eeb1/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>A review of the pilot backed by the International Finance Corporation proposes extra coaching, stronger trainer preparation and new teaching materials.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:01:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Six survivors reach Berbera after cargo boat from Djibouti sinks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/six-survivors-reach-berbera-after-cargo-boat-from-djibouti-65e6a0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/six-survivors-reach-berbera-after-cargo-boat-from-djibouti-65e6a0/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>The Somaliland Ports Authority said two crew members died and medical teams are caring for the six rescued survivors at the port.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:52:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Djibouti secures direct Hajj flights and medical care for 2027 pilgrims</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-secures-direct-hajj-flights-and-medical-care-for-728bc8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-secures-direct-hajj-flights-and-medical-care-for-728bc8/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>Agreements with Saudi providers also cover lodging, meals and ground transport in Mecca and Medina, plus airport help for older and less mobile travellers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:03:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-secures-direct-hajj-flights-and-medical-care-for-728bc8/share.jpg" length="44423" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-secures-direct-hajj-flights-and-medical-care-for-728bc8/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
